.claude/

# ─── Operational material — this repository is PUBLIC ──────────────
# Runbooks and the AI knowledge seed describe the internal estate:
# hypervisor addressing, per-VM roles, GPU PCI slots, deploy procedure.
# None of it contains credentials, but together it is a map of the
# private network and does not belong in a world-readable repository.
# Keep these locally and back them up somewhere private.
infra/
scripts/seed-ai-knowledge.cjs

